01:02:37.930 --> 01:03:04.770
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org, where you can stream our archive of over 800 episodes for absolutely free on your summer road trips or wherever. Again, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's confounder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He and I have been debating what costumes we're going to wear to this year's Star Trek convention. He always wants us to be Vulcans, like Mr. Spock.

01:03:04.770 --> 01:03:07.610
<v Sarah Polley>We're going to have to pin our ears and go after this thing.

